e in under 90% of normal in 36 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 5 grids. In 2025, the middle saw April to May at 160% of normal and July to August at 64%. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 41% on the middle. All 5 grids had their driest year in 1987, with grid 22989 at 63%.</p>"}
